                <pb facs="1037" n="1025" sameAs="frus:frus1943v03/pg1025"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">390.1115A/1574: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harrison</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-05-29">May 29, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1292. American interests Hong Kong. Your 2812 May 7. Department desires that
                    Swiss Legation Tokyo inform Intercroix delegate Hong Kong of eligibility of
                    qualified Filipinos to receive financial assistance subject to provisions of
                    Department’s 960 April 23 and that as American nationals they should be
                    permitted access to delegate.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
